creature WeatherSystem
  traits
    condition is text
  end traits

  when born
    give self the trait condition to "Sunny"
  end born

  action rain
    give self the trait condition to "Rainy"
    say "The sky darkens. It starts to rain."
  end action

  action clear_up
    give self the trait condition to "Sunny"
    say "The clouds part. It is sunny again."
  end action
end creature

creature Citizen
  traits
    name is text
  end traits

  when born with (name)
    give self the trait name to name
  end born

  action go_outside
    when self knows anyone as weather
      give w to self weather
      when w condition == "Sunny"
        say self name + " goes outside with sunglasses."
      otherwise
        say self name + " grabs an umbrella and goes outside."
      end when
    end when
  end action
end creature

bring Sky to life as WeatherSystem
bring Bob to life as Citizen with ("Bob")

Bob knows Sky as weather

Bob does go_outside
Sky does rain
Bob does go_outside
Sky does clear_up
Bob does go_outside
